James, already aware of some of the curses and strange happenings (the alley demon, the missing girl spirit, and his own reflection glitching), decided it was time to confront the root of the problem—no matter the cost.



🔫 The Cult Hideout Operation
Armed with the knowledge from Nitta, the pair began planning their next move. Mai, a talented hacker, used her skills to track down a reliable arms dealer on the dark web, and James, with his Texas upbringing, was more than comfortable around firearms. They managed to acquire weapons—a handgun, knives, taser, and other gear—that would help them confront whatever they were about to face.


With Nitta’s phone confiscated to prevent him from alerting anyone and his car as a getaway, the duo set off to find the cult's hideout. They knew the cult was not performing its rituals at the school but were sure they’d be able to trace it back to an off-site location.


Upon arriving, they found the cult in the midst of a classic occult ritual: candles, robes, pentagrams, and chanting. They had no time to waste, so James immediately took action, knee-capping the ringleader and disrupting the summoning ritual by knocking over the ritual objects.



🧨 Ritual Disrupted – Chaos Ensues
James’s violent interruption of the ritual had unintended consequences. One of the cultists fell directly into the summoning circle, and the ritual backfired, creating a Curse Womb—a grotesque, growing entity that began to take shape.


James, though caught off guard, quickly adapted to the situation. He opened fire on the cultists, demanded answers from them, and used accelerants (gasoline and a secondary canister of accelerant) to destroy the ritual site by setting it ablaze.


As James attempted to escape, the door sealed itself with supernatural force, trapping them for a moment. But his practicality and quick thinking led him to kick the door open and get out just in time.


The curse womb, along with the remaining unstable curse, was destroyed in the explosion, ending the immediate threat and leaving the hideout in ruins.



